# macOS leaves these files everywhere:
.DS_Store
# Created by `lake exe cache get` if no home directory is available
.cache
# `lake` stores its files here:
.lake
# Written by `make docs`:
/docbuild/lake-manifest.json
/docbuild/lean-toolchain
/docbuild/docs/
# Blueprint build output (`leanblueprint web`):
/blueprint/web/
/blueprint/lean_decls
/blueprint/src/*.paux
# Python
__pycache__
